Enumeration TitleIPartASchoolDesignation
    documentation 'Denotes the Title I Part A designation for the school.
    item Not designated as a Title I Part A school
    item Title I Part A Schoolwide Assistance Program School
    item Title I Part A Targeted Assistance School
    item Title I targeted eligible school - no program
    item Title I targeted school
    item Title I school wide eligible - Title I targeted program
    item Title I school wide eligible school - no program

